events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/f050aeb064a763102d26b957438c8744a773574e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:03:42Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:03:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(deps): upgrade css-loader to 7 with CSS Modules config fix (#51)\n\ncss-loader 7 flips esModule/modules.namedExport to true by default,\nwhich broke the module''s default-import pattern\n(import styles from ''./VersionsCleaner.scss''; styles.vc_container ->\nTypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined). This crashed the admin\nUI and failed 3 Cypress specs.\n\nFix in webpack.config.js: set modules.namedExport=false (restores the\nlocals object as the default export) and exportLocalsConvention=''as-is''\n(preserves the literal vc_ class names). No JSX changes needed.\n\n- css-loader ^6.8.1 -> ^7.1.4\n- Verified: full Cypress suite green (45/45); vc_ class names preserved\n  in the built bundle.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"308b122a47d69ef6c575f967d3bcb7b6a61ecd39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/308b122a47d69ef6c575f967d3bcb7b6a61ecd39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/f050aeb064a763102d26b957438c8744a773574e","verification":{"payload":"tree 308b122a47d69ef6c575f967d3bcb7b6a61ecd39\nparent 202c7c8ba8502c968b4efdffda976cbcbe3b61ea\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783512222 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783512222 +0200\n\nfeat(deps): upgrade css-loader to 7 with CSS Modules config fix (#51)\n\ncss-loader 7 flips esModule/modules.namedExport to true by default,\nwhich broke the module''s default-import pattern\n(import styles from ''./VersionsCleaner.scss''; styles.vc_container ->\nTypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined). This crashed the admin\nUI and failed 3 Cypress specs.\n\nFix in webpack.config.js: set modules.namedExport=false (restores the\nlocals object as the default export) and exportLocalsConvention=''as-is''\n(preserves the literal vc_ class names). No JSX changes needed.\n\n- css-loader ^6.8.1 -> ^7.1.4\n- Verified: full Cypress suite green (45/45); vc_ class names preserved\n  in the built bundle.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTjyeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+XMQAFpfMEpzPwIBc+YOsAOyAcwN\nSgUPz9BJSqlboKB0t5M79K1IJGGOHG8kqfLg7PNqNmByou/BKWyNjt9N+4v545MD\nJzvB91qX5srg759/9Roa8xOfIuS5qsQOlQymwN71PfKT4JuSo+OpDBhUpWHQHfN9\n97epuDs8zVAUHSJHVYFlNltL+qFXA7xEgiQ2JwanQiL1HInCieoEOXRw12cK3nJv\n5v36Kct3jL0pgIJQ/wuYjlFYQEwadhmuwVWdp39CGQtFPK4tLgWywRQB/ZyADyJZ\nICgGGM7TjKvxl/9nPLLMhIqFWTYerUNCL4Cs2mqtcNoqWM48FFkI4iZVhqveSGer\nGHnuje9N4oWcq2zpQQfKPrazEmRUeg7tWZGaO6S3+GgEhqqKDeUoF9V4hLNxaOSs\nfjmD2hg3ub1ckWLpUowbWabreKYClHty2KIzHf3JSSwJi3k3yCkQPP0s8m3f0ZyE\npznzpjuMLRpf+jSMGmZfRzcQPm5DSLSgBBcdMosOC10IMKVvtywdWI7GSgax5Cel\n5t+4yZev/HNBKFj97klodkja9RICkrDb3D10w2uQX901TjmiFkxVJ+JNAtC4uMSo\nChqw5jXbenYT6B1msNqOzw54hpkJryA7/dVQqZTeMjoMcowmECxSTEtfnwihcQ1t\nuZ2W03qxMjW7BT+MoGNA\n=gsdI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-08T12:03:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists