epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/202c7c8ba8502c968b4efdffda976cbcbe3b61ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:03:26Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:03:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): pin qs and uuid to patched versions (tests) (#50)\n\nTwo transitive dev-dependency alerts in tests/yarn.lock:\n- qs: the ~6.14.1 tree resolved to 6.14.2 (vuln >=6.11.1,<=6.15.1; DoS in\n  qs.stringify). Range can''t reach the 6.15.2 patch -> pin qs ^6.15.2.\n- uuid: resolved to 8.3.2 (vuln <11.1.1; missing buffer bounds check).\n  Pin uuid ^11.1.1.\n\nClassic-compatible global resolutions (matching sibling modules such as\nprivateappstore). Both trees now resolve patched: qs 6.15.3, uuid 11.1.1.\n\nVerified: full Cypress suite green (45/45).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4e0fad157f9b00159f76ed3a10555d7e7981b4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/d4e0fad157f9b00159f76ed3a10555d7e7981b4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/202c7c8ba8502c968b4efdffda976cbcbe3b61ea","verification":{"payload":"tree d4e0fad157f9b00159f76ed3a10555d7e7981b4a\nparent 1b368d73a43aaee1752627844bf7ea426f8604b7\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783512206 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783512206 +0200\n\nfix(deps): pin qs and uuid to patched versions (tests) (#50)\n\nTwo transitive dev-dependency alerts in tests/yarn.lock:\n- qs: the ~6.14.1 tree resolved to 6.14.2 (vuln >=6.11.1,<=6.15.1; DoS in\n  qs.stringify). Range can''t reach the 6.15.2 patch -> pin qs ^6.15.2.\n- uuid: resolved to 8.3.2 (vuln <11.1.1; missing buffer bounds check).\n  Pin uuid ^11.1.1.\n\nClassic-compatible global resolutions (matching sibling modules such as\nprivateappstore). Both trees now resolve patched: qs 6.15.3, uuid 11.1.1.\n\nVerified: full Cypress suite green (45/45).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTjyOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkyAQAB5SSeS2v1Zi28qKWUfMu7hf\nPfoGWC60xt4T147R1SedPyq6ZQMhui5TzWzK4KF1W+2b8WXmcrRuPB8UaZQKBSKK\nrAtlPgmlN2uOE6I0v44JSduGQTUMfxklN21XNcs3KR5WiuP+e7jesAUVux5SolnB\nRL8C5MoQwd1sDbNRtb+d4bOwm4kn+I8RjI/C2Ox/YI9auxR4redjyAPewJ5yJsch\nq3Ba8oDaGrIyDSJ3A7N/COtl0hVl+1wmYFZZEknXUZA4wWLmmjRVcBXFYyj6CgzH\nU+3PqOyxztzlkWacLtKBrsA/s1n2Be79ekvVkmVSumomkc/j3SH6RbGcebOWEL+b\nDSrA4Dwur5J8/6SofaKf3q95++P8y+ShAj5xU5OHJLPFx2IFLLTCOANOfRQI+neI\nSMW3eedfWZ48bWsrtcIi88JY0KBjMPYuP4FURz6TOoG1bN6nOBKwB4J7nwUcW5gL\nMgsluZoV9KkIfER7gdbBBlM+P96gB808L6PZmqzYrkpQ68jK4DYYEvNShVkMbe4x\nvQo2A6tilsFfAannjaVaUMjSgupAyc5CkeLEr6qbfnYoQEW6l9RZc2B31+o5YaNk\nGsC5qr2/+Ff7CkW8JRISU92prKBJC1nlYJfLnDLfXZOTala3+mkr7GJMt+k6MABM\n8+IWezHMwPN/KUw3ip4q\n=UX/M\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-08T12:03:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commit/202c7c8ba8502c968b4efdffda976cbcbe3b61ea","node_id":"C_kwDOHECKV9oAKDIwMmM3YzhiYTg1MDJjOTY4YjRlZmRmZmRhOTc2Y2JjYmUzYjYxZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commit/1b368d73a43aaee1752627844bf7ea426f8604b7","sha":"1b368d73a43aaee1752627844bf7ea426f8604b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/1b368d73a43aaee1752627844bf7ea426f8604b7"}],"sha":"202c7c8ba8502c968b4efdffda976cbcbe3b61ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/202c7c8ba8502c968b4efdffda976cbcbe3b61ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/1b368d73a43aaee1752627844bf7ea426f8604b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T11:37:46Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T11:37:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): Cypress-verified version updates (safe subset) (#49)\n\n* fix(tests): use Yarn Classic for the Cypress harness (repair CI)\n\nThe @jahia/cypress harness builds a generated env.Dockerfile that runs\n`yarn install` with Yarn Classic 1.22.x. The tests project was the only\nsupport module carrying a Berry tests/yarn.lock, which Classic ignored\n(non-reproducible installs). The recently added Berry-scoped resolution\nkeys (e.g. \"form-data@^2.2.0\") are unparseable by Classic, so the test\nimage failed to build and no specs ran.\n\nAlign tests/ with every sibling module (Classic):\n- drop Berry .yarnrc.yml and Berry lockfile; commit a Classic v1 yarn.lock\n- keep only Classic-compatible (global) resolutions\n\nA fresh Classic resolve picks latest-satisfying, so the previously\nalerted transitive deps land patched without scoped keys:\nform-data 2.5.6 / 4.0.6, js-yaml 3.15.0 / 4.3.0, tar 7.5.19, undici 6.27.0.\n\nVerified: full Cypress suite green (45/45) via ci.build.sh + ci.startup.sh.\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* chore(deps): apply safe version updates (Cypress-verified)\n\nVersion-update bumps that build and pass the full Cypress suite (45/45).\n\nRoot (package.json):\n- @babel/preset-env 7.29.7, @babel/preset-react 7.29.7\n- sass 1.101.0, rimraf 6.1.3, webpack-bundle-analyzer 5.3.0\n\nTests (tests/package.json):\n- @jahia/cypress 8.2.1, mocha 11.7.6, graphql-tag 2.12.7\n\nMaven (pom.xml):\n- graphql-dxm-provider 3.6.0, mockito-core 5.23.0\n- frontend-maven-plugin 2.0.1 (NOTE: requires a Java 17 build JDK)\n\nHeld back (break build/tests -> see follow-up notes), left to dedicated PRs:\n- css-loader 7 (#38): CSS Modules interop change -> module UI crashes\n  (TypeError reading ''vc_container''); needs webpack-config/JSX migration\n- i18next 26 (#40): Module Federation shared-singleton mismatch; needs\n  platform-coordinated version alignment\n- @babel/core 8 (#44) + @babel/preset-env 8 tests (#39) + @cypress/webpack-preprocessor 7\n  (#35): require babel-loader 9/10 co-bump; cascading peer conflicts\n- frontend-maven-plugin note: 2.0.1 needs Java 17 (was v55/Java 11 before)\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"748587767411de4f36b550e84fce3fa0e8755679","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/748587767411de4f36b550e84fce3fa0e8755679"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/1b368d73a43aaee1752627844bf7ea426f8604b7","verification":{"payload":"tree 748587767411de4f36b550e84fce3fa0e8755679\nparent c866032e11a2f07b35c4b58a6d69113c467cd9de\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783510666 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783510666 +0200\n\nchore(deps): Cypress-verified version updates (safe subset) (#49)\n\n* fix(tests): use Yarn Classic for the Cypress harness (repair CI)\n\nThe @jahia/cypress harness builds a generated env.Dockerfile that runs\n`yarn install` with Yarn Classic 1.22.x. The tests project was the only\nsupport module carrying a Berry tests/yarn.lock, which Classic ignored\n(non-reproducible installs). The recently added Berry-scoped resolution\nkeys (e.g. \"form-data@^2.2.0\") are unparseable by Classic, so the test\nimage failed to build and no specs ran.\n\nAlign tests/ with every sibling module (Classic):\n- drop Berry .yarnrc.yml and Berry lockfile; commit a Classic v1 yarn.lock\n- keep only Classic-compatible (global) resolutions\n\nA fresh Classic resolve picks latest-satisfying, so the previously\nalerted transitive deps land patched without scoped keys:\nform-data 2.5.6 / 4.0.6, js-yaml 3.15.0 / 4.3.0, tar 7.5.19, undici 6.27.0.\n\nVerified: full Cypress suite green (45/45) via ci.build.sh + ci.startup.sh.\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* chore(deps): apply safe version updates (Cypress-verified)\n\nVersion-update bumps that build and pass the full Cypress suite (45/45).\n\nRoot (package.json):\n- @babel/preset-env 7.29.7, @babel/preset-react 7.29.7\n- sass 1.101.0, rimraf 6.1.3, webpack-bundle-analyzer 5.3.0\n\nTests (tests/package.json):\n- @jahia/cypress 8.2.1, mocha 11.7.6, graphql-tag 2.12.7\n\nMaven (pom.xml):\n- graphql-dxm-provider 3.6.0, mockito-core 5.23.0\n- frontend-maven-plugin 2.0.1 (NOTE: requires a Java 17 build JDK)\n\nHeld back (break build/tests -> see follow-up notes), left to dedicated PRs:\n- css-loader 7 (#38): CSS Modules interop change -> module UI crashes\n  (TypeError reading ''vc_container''); needs webpack-config/JSX migration\n- i18next 26 (#40): Module Federation shared-singleton mismatch; needs\n  platform-coordinated version alignment\n- @babel/core 8 (#44) + @babel/preset-env 8 tests (#39) + @cypress/webpack-preprocessor 7\n  (#35): require babel-loader 9/10 co-bump; cascading peer conflicts\n- frontend-maven-plugin note: 2.0.1 needs Java 17 (was v55/Java 11 before)\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTjaKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXEwQAAS2LyZO+N20R8XXdMzLp6vq\ntuNL5B4UZVAjtJSoql2TKquYcokaoR890/naD9UIC7OsVKElKKLypZ39vv7kpODb\nClMBZO0G6IcLtmSO7qawDXnt7FTGZtOB9lYlExjV8HxdoIUsqPwhkCVM6aGPocck\nv9d7Z+oYRNP7zApfpjl3/2wZPclDna7tFvZ4ctuOZk0AY2ykPvcnDO7aIoE0IMRh\nUSrjRWkDZffK/AcTtaKQnuvEGbbLcUMVK53SKBql/hUTOdZHmd6+SzVi5kAlbChF\n1IHtFEXxxCb3RplirbdFYfDgu1DrMLYDell2bTo0c2b+S/kCW4+d9am5YVVKKiWy\n/Pam8dgcNFb+PMKMeYo6ohYJqXHCY4eVN/B5gS12YP/ZqZvr+7/xMR7dnltg94MG\n/18B9HGZ/rwdBnwLvXyN8xcf9T5+q69j81P90BgCcHyIOqH3QNyPF+/eB0MVu84+\nbS5ArsVmwjs9LI+XoLS9q7dcxbzfejkIs736aF0vtmQouhj376vS4R1izDE5VdSK\nRQf4JozNakzJ7ypEw0MYrtRfV8PhCFZiyMfYFm09GfDHnChooIPn1weh0nSSGUhR\nsAzBlmIasXi18GHU3o7CMY9jrjSVogMku0bwOqx/ibIiVnxufRqC483Ke9VOqgm8\nyjHKCWer7eVf/JLsFqgh\n=V+o+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","veri