:0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T08:38:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): pin remaining vulnerable transitive deps in tests project (#45)\n\nFollow-up to the first resolutions pass, which missed/mistargeted three\nopen alerts (verified against each advisory''s vulnerable_version_range):\n\n- tar (tests, runtime): first pass pinned tar in the root project only.\n  Add tar ^7.5.16 to tests resolutions -> resolves to 7.5.19.\n- form-data (tests, HIGH #10): the open advisory is the 4.x tree\n  (>=4.0.0,<4.0.6), not the 2.x line pinned earlier. Scope 4.x\n  descriptors to ^4.0.6 -> resolves to 4.0.6; 2.x stays 2.5.6.\n- js-yaml (tests #19/#20): advisory <=4.1.1, patched 4.2.0. Scope the\n  4.x descriptors to ^4.2.0 -> resolves to 4.3.0; the safe 3.x tree\n  (3.14.2) is left untouched.\n\nRoot-project alerts (tar #18, js-yaml #21) and the maven/direct-dep\nalerts are left to their existing Dependabot PRs (#15, #23, #14, #10),\nwhich update the Yarn Classic v1 root lockfile correctly.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f01bfc0ba709269a748640203c1c615066a7ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/5f01bfc0ba709269a748640203c1c615066a7ae2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/e8557e81a41023c0ba03f8e094e4d39f1b0adaf9","verification":{"payload":"tree 5f01bfc0ba709269a748640203c1c615066a7ae2\nparent c0df4074e7bc1c54a7065042673061bb3b3a9d2c\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783499923 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783499923 +0200\n\nfix(deps): pin remaining vulnerable transitive deps in tests project (#45)\n\nFollow-up to the first resolutions pass, which missed/mistargeted three\nopen alerts (verified against each advisory''s vulnerable_version_range):\n\n- tar (tests, runtime): first pass pinned tar in the root project only.\n  Add tar ^7.5.16 to tests resolutions -> resolves to 7.5.19.\n- form-data (tests, HIGH #10): the open advisory is the 4.x tree\n  (>=4.0.0,<4.0.6), not the 2.x line pinned earlier. Scope 4.x\n  descriptors to ^4.0.6 -> resolves to 4.0.6; 2.x stays 2.5.6.\n- js-yaml (tests #19/#20): advisory <=4.1.1, patched 4.2.0. Scope the\n  4.x descriptors to ^4.2.0 -> resolves to 4.3.0; the safe 3.x tree\n  (3.14.2) is left untouched.\n\nRoot-project alerts (tar #18, js-yaml #21) and the maven/direct-dep\nalerts are left to their existing Dependabot PRs (#15, #23, #14, #10),\nwhich update the Yarn Classic v1 root lockfile correctly.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTgyTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvEUQACIuGKRvDMth+0xxpEjSBtpH\nvn88hrXQy7CQG0CXNKrPV2gUXTW4up895tzhyI/NtXyh+ZB43TyNBz3tgOCg84Pl\nS+qHK7XQKBqqUobfeee2ig5JxtjnQEJw7JmNLXKB7mHsYm+0CjfuAWCp7rFnFQ1l\nMFZd5dldHZw+axMYR9fpqa+aI4cHTq0JXlcrz31ZSfibt1r5OSl25QKo92uBk+ej\n8CHFdXqnRRZMwqBWJ2CCtmNjX4/IQKZOlKAtGYKX2zPnqiCWaeXU8U1OZh0Qeoy5\nfSALH1LJ97llRVxfu/HOeEoF/PIydHE65aJoU7ketqQVjp5hvKcQaV5ENjaq4lOF\nasfahkEAFc9lB4+70cvjic+EKZ6RVBB2CtlRzkJUnaedGPvOYbkNesk2TxOOZOE6\nrbgQ0msdTetgJ1Z9evNtocBJqv+VH8edKTWGXmfR4AxS2Ufx5+EfcXXFj6aoFgUW\ndL47aLofjWsfgG8wW+rgextXySQ/dpkwFM43pioRYvQHtAc9SQfsmj0Tij6LUbk8\nnN+p2CSAd32rH9WKfuzfBkEhRp2axmzMGXa/louqMWzW17aRr1bVkU773OwM26M/\nkUJG5pd9r4mw3e6QRlNIgLAIqn1AyK3EP5cbvpJvQFYJDtQeZlso2Wr1f06G/CrY\ndfoVlV0PYMgKvnI/iITn\n=qxRE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-08T08:38:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commit/e8557e81a41023c0ba03f8e094e4d39f1b0adaf9","node_id":"C_kwDOHECKV9oAKGU4NTU3ZTgxYTQxMDIzYzBiYTAzZjhlMDk0ZTRkMzlmMWIwYWRhZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commit/c0df4074e7bc1c54a7065042673061bb3b3a9d2c","sha":"c0df4074e7bc1c54a7065042673061bb3b3a9d2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/c0df4074e7bc1c54a7065042673061bb3b3a9d2c"}],"sha":"e8557e81a41023c0ba03f8e094e4d39f1b0adaf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/e8557e81a41023c0ba03f8e094e4d39f1b0adaf9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/c0df4074e7bc1c54a7065042673061bb3b3a9d2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T08:30:09Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T08:30:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): pin vulnerable transitive deps via resolutions + repair dependabot config (#20)\n\nDependabot''s lockfile-only PRs (tar, undici, form-data) do not survive a\nlockfile regeneration because the vulnerable versions are transitive and\nonly recorded in yarn.lock. Pin them durably via package.json resolutions\nso the safe version is enforced regardless of lockfile state:\n\n- root: tar ^7.5.16 (single ^7.4.3 tree; applied on next Yarn 1 install)\n- tests: undici ^6.27.0 (single ^6.25.0 tree)\n- tests: form-data ^2.5.6 scoped to the 2.x descriptors only, leaving the\n  coexisting safe 4.x tree untouched; regenerated tests/yarn.lock confirms\n  form-data 2.x -> 2.5.6 and 4.x stays at 4.0.5\n\nAlso repair .github/dependabot.yml: the previous config had an empty\npackage-ecosystem and covered no manifests. Declare npm (/ and /tests),\nmaven (/), and github-actions so scheduled version updates actually run.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"56497d9e032ecded71e6b66e02f01255fbb544a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/56497d9e032ecded71e6b66e02f01255fbb544a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/c0df4074e7bc1c54a7065042673061bb3b3a9d2c","verification":{"payload":"tree 56497d9e032ecded71e6b66e02f01255fbb544a3\nparent d4dc59be5f23460770e651dc4423e1b93efe6fbc\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783499409 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783499409 +0200\n\nfix(deps): pin vulnerable transitive deps via resolutions + repair dependabot config (#20)\n\nDependabot''s lockfile-only PRs (tar, undici, form-data) do not survive a\nlockfile regeneration because the vulnerable versions are transitive and\nonly recorded in yarn.lock. Pin them durably via package.json resolutions\nso the safe version is enforced regardless of lockfile state:\n\n- root: tar ^7.5.16 (single ^7.4.3 tree; applied on next Yarn 1 install)\n- tests: undici ^6.27.0 (single ^6.25.0 tree)\n- tests: form-data ^2.5.6 scoped to the 2.x descriptors only, leaving the\n  coexisting safe 4.x tree untouched; regenerated tests/yarn.lock confirms\n  form-data 2.x -> 2.5.6 and 4.x stays at 4.0.5\n\nAlso repair .github/dependabot.yml: the previous config had an empty\npackage-ecosystem and covered no manifests. Declare npm (/ and /tests),\nmaven (/), and github-actions so scheduled version updates actually run.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTgqRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADq8QAGBa6ddBJq6dW8uzk8hEYOLm\nF2N2MDyeS0dKIGPl/xCmlpx4VqHyNvLNn1/BwgjSpm0vofomx5uUsD01EFA1n84J\n7cDpBI0GnUrl+VnftIKFRD7l8EImElcmGUHADFzouQqyQtmpSmDhxJCIQKL+16J1\n6OXBYTtVEb42dqHkKVaaH8KZ2hYdqKcg3QkCs4qKbhEiA7E/napmkWT9zkQ/MU6A\nhH4I0NBOnpMUqSY6NmTjJ8oMQbaGUEtg9Gv+ZdplP4cwheM0XwVU7umcmVnVtZAq\nPkViWxfWUvVEP6TJY2vX6g/p3NglJfBrIIxpIy4EscaB7RuX+NqX68SIztb7SkNM\nn6DKpNsw4cRHr6aUxYyFjgbAhGofEq70/FXMQ7TQUof/1desCp8se1fqEM85MVgJ\n5mdstHSOjHVbyPDBYDviM21M0YGwa8q9NegguSu2iz6EjEXT33BxBmfBlBe5p6PN\npDW7m53wGIENm/pTwg0b0StPwErjHknfMOV9FxuznUq9/yrLEwUlx+hH39e4uPRS\n9obSYf8IoHa8aIMwdA3jNSYVIUWkrlt/r0BH5Vri+LXVbjxBbOgOEPlzUpgHzJrI\nF/ozJY1kuDCdaA6qHm/drTtOFfgLYJyMJnfHw1tLqz+4n2cSpzrEFxED09kv/ghf\nbZ9tyb2oJIMCwN0kfDMF\n=of5W\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-08T08:30:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","followin