.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/d4dc59be5f23460770e651dc4423e1b93efe6fbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:29:30Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:29:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a versionsCleaner namespace container (#19)\n\nMove the 4 root Query + 5 root Mutation flat fields (versionsCleaner*) under one\nhierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    versionsCleanerIsRunning -> versionsCleaner { isRunning }, etc.\n- Mutation: versionsCleanerRun       -> versionsCleaner { run }, etc.\n\nNew holder types VersionsCleanerQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (the GqlVersionsCleanerConfig return type moves into the query\nholder); the *Extension classes keep a single accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission\nstays on each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"83840c13c7aa9d2699cdcde8955f45fd3aeab11c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/83840c13c7aa9d2699cdcde8955f45fd3aeab11c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/d4dc59be5f23460770e651dc4423e1b93efe6fbc","verification":{"payload":"tree 83840c13c7aa9d2699cdcde8955f45fd3aeab11c\nparent 4ee5aa9cb4ada906e459b20e7646680a70376b96\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782026970 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782026970 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a versionsCleaner namespace container (#19)\n\nMove the 4 root Query + 5 root Mutation flat fields (versionsCleaner*) under one\nhierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    versionsCleanerIsRunning -> versionsCleaner { isRunning }, etc.\n- Mutation: versionsCleanerRun       -> versionsCleaner { run }, etc.\n\nNew holder types VersionsCleanerQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (the GqlVersionsCleanerConfig return type moves into the query\nholder); the *Extension classes keep a single accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission\nstays on each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqN5LaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoc8QABirZWvd6LEACs4vrKhE2gQw\ne4lcM1glf69lURlwBvBXSZqZpGPz0Yh+2NzylGnDBir35mGC+mbiH3xeIZkgr8up\ngdj5wr+muq40b/sAzoGfSSt8pGBTfeYBdykRjEvVVWQ8uLdD+LkRZbORVsdeIzsY\ndlPtAdyF74mVPA8TgtWEZ3Y8BlA19rUKjRV3bvpMPHfsiQFC7AsIZTZdzVFEMcSk\neJZ7feqtCSBLAk3BLcsYej5VFLi47nBCbsjwC32BmwGogK8X/yDyRLHKmqZYUoBH\nK9wfqeXyBCFKKXRNNRX53h3FSy510w96QIuw6L7QM/ShTgYPdAGO32Xenzu+gjX7\nhfqLpY8Qrpo9H7wRlTfMx18i6nrWNYhw6TbJd2RfW8kIHoQlGwb0T5+9Y7Sommye\nBFu8I/ZYsLNKJgc1ML2WMWmuEU5W7Yjl6Qjdz6LRY27v8GrPZSkIEpAmhIIhn4Yj\nxy5aE1vtp//oH9JyHD2H12oBDv2b2uCq1LreWZAYky4wcVTJbST8CQycX+knlcA8\nE0igtZPTKCTOEBxKveupav39JRvTv/p2inEiEJTrION9yGgM4BxyhqzYcxrCmbux\nMkoNdebrNfxF807uFXmNy73hKTpuE6XvrsbjfGE0cNdGSPWwMyrm9TuevitYA/is\nBw2FXbottWv06xguVWLf\n=g9Q3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-21T07:29:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/