b96","node_id":"C_kwDOHECKV9oAKDRlZTVhYTljYjRhZGE5MDZlNDU5YjIwZTc2NDY2ODBhNzAzNzZiOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commit/6843366795060f91ae03e878867d0dfd5eb13e3c","sha":"6843366795060f91ae03e878867d0dfd5eb13e3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/6843366795060f91ae03e878867d0dfd5eb13e3c"}],"sha":"4ee5aa9cb4ada906e459b20e7646680a70376b96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/4ee5aa9cb4ada906e459b20e7646680a70376b96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/6843366795060f91ae03e878867d0dfd5eb13e3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:06:23Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:06:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#12)\n\nAdd regression coverage for the versionsCleanerAdmin fine-grained permission\nacross the whole stack, plus an assignable server role so the permission can\nbe granted without full server-administrator rights.\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: new ''versions-cleaner-administrator'' server role\n  granting only ''administrationAccess versionsCleanerAdmin''.\n- tests/cypress/e2e/05-versionsCleaner-Permissions.cy.ts: 4 tests\n  - GraphQL: denies versionsCleanerIsRunning for an ungranted user\n    (Permission denied), allows it for a user holding only the role.\n  - Admin UI: hides the admin panel from an ungranted user, shows it to a\n    user holding only the role.\n- pom.xml: bump module version 2.3.3 -> 2.3.4-SNAPSHOT so the new roles.xml\n  import content is re-imported on deploy.\n\nNo inner hardcoded ''admin'' resolver check exists; the\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"versionsCleanerAdmin\") annotation is the only\nbackend gate, so no Java relaxation was needed.\n\nValidated: ./ci.build.sh && ./ci.startup.sh -> 45/45 specs pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"9000bacc81b034bff6bfe3082b9a53bb1ec47c04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/9000bacc81b034bff6bfe3082b9a53bb1ec47c04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/6843366795060f91ae03e878867d0dfd5eb13e3c","verification":{"payload":"tree 9000bacc81b034bff6bfe3082b9a53bb1ec47c04\nparent 1083468839f120a390f063fe9c766a61aee58431\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781118383 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781118383 +0200\n\ntest: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#12)\n\nAdd regression coverage for the versionsCleanerAdmin fine-grained permission\nacross the whole stack, plus an assignable server role so the permission can\nbe granted without full server-administrator rights.\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: new ''versions-cleaner-administrator'' server role\n  granting only ''administrationAccess versionsCleanerAdmin''.\n- tests/cypress/e2e/05-versionsCleaner-Permissions.cy.ts: 4 tests\n  - GraphQL: denies versionsCleanerIsRunning for an ungranted user\n    (Permission denied), allows it for a user holding only the role.\n  - Admin UI: hides the admin panel from an ungranted user, shows it to a\n    user holding only the role.\n- pom.xml: bump module version 2.3.3 -> 2.3.4-SNAPSHOT so the new roles.xml\n  import content is re-imported on deploy.\n\nNo inner hardcoded ''admin'' resolver check exists; the\n@GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"versionsCleanerAdmin\") annotation is the only\nbackend gate, so no Java relaxation was needed.\n\nValidated: ./ci.build.sh && ./ci.startup.sh -> 45/45 specs pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKbWvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACRkQALDp5cWKFiO9gTi8epKrFele\nhG7a3rLSTZle1ke2YP7IkIb3rZ3ZsAK/oO4v8jD+Kj+c/4fTJoKQL6NuMNw2Th8r\nD5uLH9m1cwJd8AhK4B+lRzPhW5eYCtHqqfXteEZ/vl8EXN7Q5cn/MQw9jc05DTbx\n01GdrPLDyNgWpo1zLdmOEGVz1/GtYoCymKJ6YDGzwji+IVJzMGjplDmOS1Zp85YD\nsJ6j8GvYYXKCI1/ghl3J04KrQFYe4YlmWFVcF8mbQfpV+xVePbAqtHDskTs5X5to\ngXBglWY2b5PMp4xKfbQQgMpUL8qF0q3kFbeT/tqSE1UYPvC8L3GOPU/565IUyD84\n+FR7oI6pG2FmpvqMgmPH4WNSyX8IhY4lHvlC1mZTw3LwicGN7PRWwOPmAt/BPGKw\nTDdoZknxrlZvbHj8BZ7PfWubYnTwcgh/wVGWyfaAsn8/3Zrc+s6wSVDXZYD12C9+\nTZflE7aLDpI/190hrHsy7qGbFAtJrymCtE9GM7uy3VDXYzT8yW1eOPM7yitlouNp\nAR/NU6FjurZRK/OAXyEjXsRyIi/44Ckz9UfXt2Ap0mzKqTJ8ic3FbX3Zz8T6/EfP\nZ/kMHjjtp2y0iwp1Fkd4Lz9/Da9B16RtdC4+eqTGOzCtPhL45qAyVlq/4sliTrUf\nTRmobJ41VVSVeJkihCdH\n=0wET\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T19:06:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","grava