ns_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/1083468839f120a390f063fe9c766a61aee58431/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:41:07Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:41:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add module-specific versionsCleanerAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC (#11)\n\n* feat: add module-specific versionsCleanerAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC\n\nDefine jnt:permission node versionsCleanerAdmin as a child of admin in\nsrc/main/import/permissions.xml so it is installed into JCR on first\ndeployment. Replace all @GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"admin\") usages in\nVersionsCleanerQueryExtension (4 sites) and VersionsCleanerMutationExtension\n(5 sites) with @GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"versionsCleanerAdmin\").\n\nFull admins continue to work via JCR privilege inheritance; non-admins can\nnow be granted only the versionsCleanerAdmin permission.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* fix: update requiredPermission to module-specific permission in frontend registration\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"101ea1759072bb5a3512cef0bc06530e7e16d134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/101ea1759072bb5a3512cef0bc06530e7e16d134"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/1083468839f120a390f063fe9c766a61aee58431","verification":{"payload":"tree 101ea1759072bb5a3512cef0bc06530e7e16d134\nparent a213b8a141a6370300f4d491953e1ddfba9380dc\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781084467 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781084467 +0200\n\nfeat: add module-specific versionsCleanerAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC (#11)\n\n* feat: add module-specific versionsCleanerAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC\n\nDefine jnt:permission node versionsCleanerAdmin as a child of admin in\nsrc/main/import/permissions.xml so it is installed into JCR on first\ndeployment. Replace all @GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"admin\") usages in\nVersionsCleanerQueryExtension (4 sites) and VersionsCleanerMutationExtension\n(5 sites) with @GraphQLRequiresPermission(\"versionsCleanerAdmin\").\n\nFull admins continue to work via JCR privilege inheritance; non-admins can\nnow be granted only the versionsCleanerAdmin permission.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* fix: update requiredPermission to module-specific permission in frontend registration\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKTEzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAURUQADWmeDqQk+7HAiJhEZdEusAR\niHZy/JFmGgbR+wagA4iISDN33M+KC1sEiaX2rQM6Acjd/gyMlouuNZYJDcL+uBKC\nRgE6vJ533VQ6yOg/Ha/HShiLDqwkmvpZJ/DPSRs8BpLYNjwQKqZz8+OSygI93Yf0\nZKUF4MsushYBbTOBp7tiJdXSqpzdWgvlfDPlJTyYmaGBXJ2JK9RVb8d02Sdfdq5o\nHwxyOHUEBGAYr2UHIPFpAz07hK0gAMSXYyMtK/L/KawZHjhjbwZuCUQUbHWcUFL0\nZ2gtSUGqip7bucLxsT+gI4aeAO5djhXrXTp3uemyK+QoKs+xcTJ9+mPfY9t4z4FB\nrcX5LX/SBzcBhzm0+GI2bn3luGx58Lj5dN3pOhqFu8SX576f61vLpWe8R+cZJlVv\n4YHPgCS3rTx8H+XVIiErJoIVI5uYCh8PQFRA1ccgLeWFjTSvfAe8hzhlgls83qXM\nM15bR0UFUNMLyvOG0OSTWbdnaTbqdDG600Ex3OeEERthFJ98mRZZouX/GA1oDRlP\nKMpqrA/8Bl8nJwIHksmQ9JPlM1+pUWMT6Wwmwyj3QotY/oHAXiMmiIilCcoF5Rmc\nCmG1odB+Ij3wey4SUABFilJzGN2bqHFNwFWKFB5tRN+UtzgAY9oMMIU084Hg+9Rv\n1XAHS9T0k46fRrl3yhzT\n=Zrmn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T09:41:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"ht