s://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/93aa611bed462aded2a6a64be720123b37990ba5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:47:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:47:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"chore: remove dead reschedulePurge.groovy script\n\nThe script references SpringContextSingleton, JobSchedulingBean, and the\nscheduled-versions-purge Spring bean, none of which exist in the current\npure OSGi DS architecture. Keeping the script is misleading and it would\nthrow a runtime error if executed. Rescheduling is now done via the\nVersionsCleanerScheduler DS component and OSGi ConfigurationAdmin.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a6402f2cca7f37b1fedb3ca63987db649faec1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/3a6402f2cca7f37b1fedb3ca63987db649faec1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/93aa611bed462aded2a6a64be720123b37990ba5","verification":{"payload":"tree 3a6402f2cca7f37b1fedb3ca63987db649faec1a\nparent 39af6919eb024afcf3dc178a77396f103701bff3\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750048 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750048 +0200\n\nchore: remove dead reschedulePurge.groovy script\n\nThe script references SpringContextSingleton, JobSchedulingBean, and the\nscheduled-versions-purge Spring bean, none of which exist in the current\npure OSGi DS architecture. Keeping the script is misleading and it would\nthrow a runtime error if executed. Rescheduling is now done via the\nVersionsCleanerScheduler DS component and OSGi ConfigurationAdmin.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFuAACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lu5Af9FT1Ztm5X4wqEnISig5gSo+mg01vNv0NJUF5ajPdxlSL1nIYP0dwjMQd8\n/A3QwagkNSjF7vQzEn4kaRRwmMYXbfLjBUENqqNm9nAiRMONUUk5AcXTnuaSy3lQ\nutagJ5CAG20IRRmryh8l1pADmLdqmt6kLKq4V6EMAAU/76oPZCQE8kAAOAnjxUyC\nwuq+6ayPM9cKDmeDfiPAqkEnKjRavVWywlgeciQ+jIAy9VwyB588x51kQ925MLRc\nY450+UaucxV4CTilDPrYK9siPU7DfubAaedlMHsIMVl6Y6Nt+IdPqWaDxoYKny7Z\nV5l0VQ0Ry2r4U1znv5viVaAjMCVKhQ==\n=jGQr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:38:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commit/93aa611bed462aded2a6a64be720123b37990ba5","node_id":"C_kwDOHECKV9oAKDkzYWE2MTFiZWQ0NjJhZGVkMmE2YTY0YmU3MjAxMjNiMzc5OTBiYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commit/39af6919eb024afcf3dc178a77396f103701bff3","sha":"39af6919eb024afcf3dc178a77396f103701bff3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/39af6919eb024afcf3dc178a77396f103701bff3"}],"sha":"93aa611bed462aded2a6a64be720123b37990ba5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/93aa611bed462aded2a6a64be720123b37990ba5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/39af6919eb024afcf3dc178a77396f103701bff3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:47:20Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:47:20Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: replace single-use executor with named daemon thread to prevent thread-pool leak (Sonar S2095)\n\nExecutors.newSingleThreadExecutor() was created per async run and never\nshut down, causing a thread-pool leak on every invocation and failing the\nSonar quality gate. Replace with a single named daemon Thread\n(versions-cleaner-worker) that is started directly.\n\nAlso handle the InterruptedException propagated by applyStartupDelay():\nafter the startup delay the thread''s interrupted flag is checked and the\nworker exits cleanly instead of proceeding with a stale interrupt state.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2dbc568384321c610a8335f49ec991c4a42f4ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/b2dbc568384321c610a8335f49ec991c4a42f4ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/39af6919eb024afcf3dc178a77396f103701bff3","verification":{"payload":"tree b2dbc568384321c610a8335f49ec991c4a42f4ac\nparent a91e53d73599fa88f8508252523258a022e882a1\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750040 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780750040 +0200\n\nfix: replace single-use executor with named daemon thread to prevent thread-pool leak (Sonar S2095)\n\nExecutors.newSingleThreadExecutor() was created per async run and never\nshut down, causing a thread-pool leak on every invocation and failing the\nSonar quality gate. Replace with a single named daemon Thread\n(versions-cleaner-worker) that is started directly.\n\nAlso handle the InterruptedException propagated by applyStartupDelay():\nafter the startup delay the thread''s interrupted flag is checked and the\nworker exits cleanly instead of proceeding with a stale interrupt state.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFtgACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3kOKggAwNcbJ2iv/2qhZUOdvgoFB5rCWtFjCyP5sUmKBg5+L2Sval5aBrRkT97z\n7aJ037BreOV41h6PqNXyD++OcLxxeH4mPpgiW+7mRhxOSULS5sBHuG4EeIyNceK6\nctIQWB6tfl5I7eEJJaerxw5ifYr