Quartz cron expression with CronExpression.isValidExpression before\n  persisting; reject otherwise to prevent storing a malformed schedule.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3967c6ee962b60eb9cccb475c2629861cb938073","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/3967c6ee962b60eb9cccb475c2629861cb938073"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/e587925e442a713e62d7ec2d30c7be2f9535fb83","verification":{"payload":"tree 3967c6ee962b60eb9cccb475c2629861cb938073\nparent 1099ebf54832fb6d863cdc7d35251ddd64cb334c\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778939239 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778939239 +0200\n\nHarden versions-cleaner against race, traversal and bad cron\n\n- CleanCommand.execute: use AtomicBoolean.compareAndSet so concurrent\n  GraphQL/Karaf invocations cannot both pass the running guard and\n  start two cleanup threads (race condition on bulk deletion).\n- CleanCommand.getNode: reject subtreePath segments equal to \".\" or\n  \"..\" so the cleanup scope cannot be redirected outside the JCR\n  version storage subtree.\n- VersionsCleanerMutationExtension.saveConfig: validate the supplied\n  Quartz cron expression with CronExpression.isValidExpression before\n  persisting; reject otherwise to prevent storing a malformed schedule.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoIdWcACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3klNAgAm07gRd1dNgr5vHalQWrtP/Ffp+xNG78rxGvBJiJZINVZOC2BzL6rEOYa\nUP7dyATuEaAsic0SXIW7nageGEXzLmUeQDwCZm5N2JhWyUcDCow9bnU3YdKns1Fa\nZUafUYkL+rdJCwh5rwoC9z9y7fPZeZSyufd4eiUpFIMHRnyI++Qqnv2uccuCFqpJ\n1uA7WmQ8ZZsgjFfTkEYFek3y9xgxsOaTIoVI0/vizZWPjHpQNuL2EJmIG5LTQ0Cz\nYywdmiCl+tas/07o6asdI/HqFWQgCKNoVp20aYzoXJKJ1I8XooKqe1idkN79SdLD\nTGCzfCntR9cdFoMYd/K8eF8WFo0kcA==\n=ibch\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_a