https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/1099ebf54832fb6d863cdc7d35251ddd64cb334c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T18:56:51Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T18:56:51Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(a11y): resolve WCAG 2.1 AA issues — C-1, C-2, M-1 to M-6, N-1 to N-3, N-6, N-7\n\nC-1 (SC 4.1.3): Replace single dynamic live region (mutating role/aria-live) with two\nfixed-role always-in-DOM regions — role=\"status\"/polite for success/info,\nrole=\"alert\"/assertive for errors — in both VersionsCleaner.jsx and SchedulerConfig.jsx.\n\nC-2 (SC 1.3.1, 4.1.2): Remove <label> wrapper on Switch toggle (had no htmlFor, AT\ncould not associate it). Switch retains aria-labelledby=\"vc-cfg-enabled-label\"\nper ARIA16 technique. Container demoted to <div>.\n\nM-1 (SC 1.4.3): Darken warning alert text #856404 → #6b4f03 (~6.3:1 on #fff8e1).\n\nM-2 (SC 1.4.11): Input borders #dadada (1.47:1) → #767676 (4.54:1 on white).\n\nM-3 (SC 2.4.7): Remove :focus selectors; keep only :focus-visible to suppress\nfocus ring for pointer users while preserving it for keyboard navigation.\n\nM-4 (SC 4.1.3): Remove setSaveStatus(null)/setRunStatus(null) before async calls —\nthe synchronous null-reset empties the live region before AT can read the new\nvalue, causing missed announcements.\n\nM-5 (SC 1.4.4): Convert all px font-size values to rem so they scale with the\nbrowser''s base font size preference.\n\nM-6 (SC 3.3.2, 4.1.2): Add required and aria-required=\"true\" to nbVersionsToKeep,\nmaxExecutionTimeInMs, and cronExpression inputs.\n\nN-1 (SC 4.1.3): Add completion announcement — prevRunning ref detects isRunning\ntrue→false transition and populates a polite live region with label.completed.\n\nN-2 (SC 2.4.3): Remove setTimeout focus redirect to sr-only live region; sighted\nkeyboard users no longer lose visible focus after async operations.\n\nN-3 (SC 3.3.1): Add aria-invalid=\"true\" + aria-describedby error span to cron\nexpression input in SchedulerConfig when saveStatus === ''error''.\n\nN-6 (SC 2.4.2): Add document.title updates via useEffect on both route components.\n\nN-7 (SC 1.3.5): Add autoComplete=\"off\" to path/expression inputs.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"a54ae99b0909d882f9581c7e1b3625846c67b312","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/a54ae99b0909d882f9581c7e1b3625846c67b312"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/1099ebf54832fb6d863cdc7d35251ddd64cb334c","verification":{"payload":"tree a54ae99b0909d882f9581c7e1b3625846c67b312\nparent 1199e7d6807e4991b2ffac613e1c413560821877\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778871411 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778871411 +0200\n\nfix(a11y): resolve WCAG 2.1 AA issues — C-1, C-2, M-1 to M-6, N-1 to N-3, N-6, N-7\n\nC-1 (SC 4.1.3): Replace single dynamic live region (mutating role/aria-live) with two\nfixed-role always-in-DOM regions — role=\"status\"/polite for success/info,\nrole=\"alert\"/assertive for errors — in both VersionsCleaner.jsx and SchedulerConfig.jsx.\n\nC-2 (SC 1.3.1, 4.1.2): Remove <label> wrapper on Switch toggle (had no htmlFor, AT\ncould not associate it). Switch retains aria-labelledby=\"vc-cfg-enabled-label\"\nper ARIA16 technique. Container demoted to <div>.\n\nM-1 (SC 1.4.3): Darken warning alert text #856404 → #6b4f03 (~6.3:1 on #fff8e1).\n\nM-2 (SC 1.4.11): Input borders #dadada (1.47:1) → #767676 (4.54:1 on white).\n\nM-3 (SC 2.4.7): Remove :focus selectors; keep only :focus-visible to suppress\nfocus ring for pointer users while preserving it for keyboard navigation.\n\nM-4 (SC 4.1.3): Remove setSaveStatus(null)/setRunStatus(null) before async calls —\nthe synchronous null-reset empties the live region before AT can read the new\nvalue, causing missed announcements.\n\nM-5 (SC 1.4.4): Convert all px font-size values to rem so they scale with the\nbrowser''s base font size preference.\n\nM-6 (SC 3.3.2, 4.1.2): Add required and aria-required=\"true\" to nbVersionsToKeep,\nmaxExecutionTimeInMs, and cronExpression inputs.\n\nN-1 (SC 4.1.3): Add completion announcement — prevRunning ref detects isRunning\ntrue→false transition and populates a polite live region with label.completed.\n\nN-2 (SC 2.4.3): Remove setTimeout focus redirect to sr-only live region; sighted\nkeyboard users no longer lose visible focus after async operations.\n\nN-3 (SC 3.3.1): Add aria-invalid=\"true\" + aria-describedby error span to cron\nexpression input in SchedulerConfig when saveStatus === ''error''.\n\nN-6 (SC 2.4.2): Add document.title updates via useEffect on both route components.\n\nN-7 (SC 1.3.5): Add autoComplete=\"off\" to path/expression inputs.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoHbHMACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nWIAf+Lgi4fHr1axi2WjH40UFKh2VXYGCPrVM1zDWmoblSPsNiJ5yEFDf2K8tH\nj5aUABGzIQtKr74NY28F3459k3xijK8akB4cbUgFyr4CofjRDJp5zmJbeUlJAnuk\nGJXT3O7J4pE7fQ5F8wDCerWxFGzvRhlAj2RLY4o3E5+Sqo2Du/7m+qmB/TqFFb6b\nrws6FE3bbprGbo9WhEc+4k7Mk3JwzROX6V8kvJcOkS9kUCoBzxc6jc+mpZRJ7FFJ\n94OehP6SDFum63Sez6tD6544Hbmp/1qgRUAVnlt75Xym1N1Sy0p4dFp8MrqwHxoM\n62e+eIPA3E3PFasryyrtKdjbVYk1FQ==\