-cleaner/commit/b4519e5589040933f7ec585794e572438d95454b","sha":"b4519e5589040933f7ec585794e572438d95454b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/b4519e5589040933f7ec585794e572438d95454b"}],"sha":"463984ffeb78ee3f330cb3eb98fa0123aa506f23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/463984ffeb78ee3f330cb3eb98fa0123aa506f23"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/b4519e5589040933f7ec585794e572438d95454b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T12:42:23Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T12:42:23Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: resolve all SonarQube issues (S3776, S2629, S5413, S1192, S112, S107, S1128, and others)\n\n- CleanCommand: extract isUuidOrphaned() and processProperty() helpers to reduce\n  cognitive complexity in isOrphanedHistory() and checkNodeIntegrity() below threshold 15\n- CleanCommand: guard all logger.debug/info calls that pass method-call arguments with\n  isDebugEnabled()/isInfoEnabled() to satisfy S2629 (conditional method invocation)\n- CleanCommand: replace index-based remove() loop with subList().clear() (S5413)\n- CleanCommand: extract removeOneVersion/pauseBetweenDeletions/performReindex helpers,\n  use FAILED_TO_REMOVE constant, SLF4J {} placeholders throughout, Thread.interrupt() fix\n- VersionsCleanerScheduler: narrow throws clauses to specific checked exceptions (S112)\n- VersionsCleanerMutationExtension: add @SuppressWarnings S107 on run() (8 required params)\n- VersionsCleanerQueryExtension: remove unused ItemNotFoundException import (S1128)\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"f05b49688b4a22b96b249672a6d86f4af63dcedf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/f05b49688b4a22b96b249672a6d86f4af63dcedf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/b4519e5589040933f7ec585794e572438d95454b","verification":{"payload":"tree f05b49688b4a22b96b249672a6d86f4af63dcedf\nparent 46a80ea2340e6fd17a673a0818e2496bf555d175\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778244143 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778244143 +0200\n\nfix: resolve all SonarQube issues (S3776, S2629, S5413, S1192, S112, S107, S1128, and others)\n\n- CleanCommand: extract isUuidOrphaned() and processProperty() helpers to reduce\n  cognitive complexity in isOrphanedHistory() and checkNodeIntegrity() below threshold 15\n- CleanCommand: guard all logger.debug/info calls that pass method-call arguments with\n  isDebugEnabled()/isInfoEnabled() to satisfy S2629 (conditional method invocation)\n- CleanCommand: replace index-based remove() loop with subList().clear() (S5413)\n- CleanCommand: extract removeOneVersion/pauseBetweenDeletions/performReindex helpers,\n  use FAILED_TO_REMOVE constant, SLF4J {} placeholders throughout, Thread.interrupt() fix\n- VersionsCleanerScheduler: narrow throws clauses to specific checked exceptions (S112)\n- VersionsCleanerMutationExtension: add @SuppressWarnings S107 on run() (8 required params)\n- VersionsCleanerQueryExtension: remove unused ItemNotFoundException import (S1128)\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmn92i8ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3k8Owf/dIE4WPmzybRHSoRL+w2iGU8T1SIiP0iwoI/0SitsWzcqOcdzIOTl6rg0\nXBoT1p5n+VfpZqcquXdaiE+NWY2vJbWq00z67ZzPvyIJx3R+42hEyqxtP42hr5av\nAcKdr2QdL6bvfiyZIQhzVfz7FCPYp0+z2rD3BuTSOGb2kCb6wuTH4WivohAtEcy4\nAvygN99fVsJsf9aE2rZ61w9Wcsu5rgMHPZCzzhaMcuBSLd650LZVW39xJi1v/yO4\n7cvbCgXRDhbuRQ2ECIrVMe6af+nbaK5SN9GTRw9CZgyeNih0w1SN8uxF+oqPoKws\nkRyGanpOGfsmmSstuARQSJYy2hyjQQ==\n=Ay2o\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-08T12:44:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commit/b4519e5589040933f7ec585794e572438d95454b","node_id":"C_kwDOHECKV9oAKGI0NTE5ZTU1ODkwNDA5MzNmN2VjNTg1Nzk0ZT