ons, versionsCleanerDeleteTestNode)\nso Cypress can verify that the cleaner actually reduces version counts\nand removes orphaned histories, not just that the API returns true.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"a60bb45305638a97db8df344b7acca85533f546a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/a60bb45305638a97db8df344b7acca85533f546a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/46a80ea2340e6fd17a673a0818e2496bf555d175","verification":{"payload":"tree a60bb45305638a97db8df344b7acca85533f546a\nparent 0e36a1b8dba58782620df0f6f63339d29eb34177\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778239787 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778239787 +0200\n\nAdd semantic correctness tests for version cleaning and orphan deletion\n\nAdds two GraphQL query helpers (versionsCleanerVersionCount,\nversionsCleanerHistoryExists) and two test-setup mutations\n(versionsCleanerCreateTestVersions, versionsCleanerDeleteTestNode)\nso Cypress can verify that the cleaner actually reduces version counts\nand removes orphaned histories, not just that the API returns true.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmn9ySsACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mTMwf+PJCkXnqsRt3JQsf6UHQ3v4UhjT5QYklCkEz2rnNegzT1xteDJrQUggSR\nEgIDqNvpIK2FaAfWOCwHvP+/g4hCqagIz6j0woUpFDxwgm21B4L4FWG3Ccjhn1db\neZlHHnVpX5H4nTsyIbenyMRqB3LBCatpU0XYcbqXlDC8e+7mK79bygsY9DgEZ7uW\nc5zbdBeRxiN2lgTFYDX+20bftHVAIA4cb3wc56gYgdfkM0ZmWnvGoaqXXQz7Djlw\n6Lw0Qa+nH1nWC9S8keIWXJmO/JxH16G0BxQxeHWglmUSQ3Lh1KoSopOX27CAwVTT\ngeAyySdkcBZbruEWSljpFsBu7kfNmw==\n=zU6L\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-08T12:11:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://a