bourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/f982df233f0710435e4ebd02f2a12712555befee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T11:12:25Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T11:12:25Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(tests): wrap Switch in id''d div; update toggle selector\n\nMoonstone''s Switch ignores the id prop — nothing reaches the DOM.\nWrapped the Switch in <div id=\"vc-cfg-scheduler-enabled\"> so the test\nhas a stable anchor, and updated the selector from [role=\"switch\"]\n(which Moonstone never renders) to #vc-cfg-scheduler-enabled.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"de3c0df8cc2b44787e0d9421361786a3061b3f9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/de3c0df8cc2b44787e0d9421361786a3061b3f9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/f982df233f0710435e4ebd02f2a12712555befee","verification":{"payload":"tree de3c0df8cc2b44787e0d9421361786a3061b3f9f\nparent 8b29a6ccc910fcc7d28e22acdd858e4f6f40b053\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778238745 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778238745 +0200\n\nfix(tests): wrap Switch in id''d div; update toggle selector\n\nMoonstone''s Switch ignores the id prop — nothing reaches the DOM.\nWrapped the Switch in <div id=\"vc-cfg-scheduler-enabled\"> so the test\nhas a stable anchor, and updated the selector from [role=\"switch\"]\n(which Moonstone never renders) to #vc-cfg-scheduler-enabled.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmn9xRkACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lMFAf/enRHBk2EtVRuQC1FFyJ41wxyA+anPxV4XeHQGorY6fiwfBhylJqFY7QU\nJA89ZTvPocYHixvRG+5KUnr4juwzwW2ySo/s92Z9V5TYFwL0O7OIOJ+i+HUVj2tI\ndWWNR4OWIGx37cTWpvdGveHHxD+UFUylSgVINSCu6kToLBpdPr1nCJB864Yn7PyC\nLHdmzHBHHHUuc2NFfpeSS961hS0HMjlAAZQV7tYUwffPPO/WQKZKDsZPM2tSTzi+\nlkBoWTCg0XLh76lyyx69+VPwJ5JuZVvGRh6b3yCEI/i3Gz0V6WHwYtON2MXKnu8R\n/D0DyPrHgt5ZuDI1I38/1O81Dwt3FA==\n=8iDA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-08T11:18:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commit/f982df233f0710435e4ebd02f2a12712555befee","node_id":"C_kwDOHECKV9oAKGY5ODJkZjIzM2YwNzEwNDM1ZTRlYmQwMmYyYTEyNzEyNTU1YmVmZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commit/8b29a6ccc910fcc7d28e22acdd858e4f6f40b053","sha":"8b29a6ccc910fcc7d28e22acdd858e4f6f40b053","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/8b29a6ccc910fcc7d28e22acdd858e4f6f40b053"}],"sha":"f982df233f0710435e4ebd02f2a12712555befee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/f982df233f0710435e4ebd02f2a12712555befee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/commits/8b29a6ccc910fcc7d28e22acdd858e4f6f40b053/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T09:33:57Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T09:33:57Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(tests): add startup delay mechanism to guarantee RUNNING window in CI\n\nOn an empty repository the cleaner finishes before Cypress can assert\nthe disabled-button state. Added versions-cleaner.startup.delay JVM\nsystem property that sleeps at the very start of the async execution\npath (after RUNNING=true, before deleteVersions), ensuring a measurable\nrunning window regardless of repo content.\n\nExposed versionsCleanerSetStartupDelay(delayMs) GraphQL mutation so the\nCypress test can arm a 5-second delay before clicking Run, then clear it\nafterwards. Zero cost in production when the property is not set.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c46ae44210d9ab2cb14a70c1f316feb797cdaf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/3c46ae44210d9ab2cb14a70c1f316feb797cdaf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/8b29a6ccc910fcc7d28e22acdd858e4f6f40b053","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c46ae44210d9ab2cb14a70c1f316feb797cdaf9\nparent cddcae9ca38425bf62310cfab67ea380cccce801\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778232837 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778232837 +0200\n\nfix(tests): add startup delay mechanism to guarantee RUNNING window in CI\n\nOn an empty repository the cleaner finishes before Cypress can assert\nthe disabled-button state. Added versions-cleaner.startup.delay JVM\nsystem property that sleeps at the very start of the async execution\npath (after RUNNING=true, before deleteVersions), ensuring a measurable\nrunning window regardless of repo content.\n\nExposed versionsCleanerSetStartupDelay(delayMs) GraphQL mutation so the\nCypress test can arm a 5-second delay before clicking Run, then clear it\nafterwards. Zero cost in production when the property is not set.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmn9rgUACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mBIAgAvIjnaomum5DWTa7zje1e811tDTtYPuM6tZ8qOx6dUdjGSgW3pXqe9NO4\nEWw3+G8Er+9l52JOkE2qFAcckKwAktCThuEnSn1hTGn5tQnxVdfxgFOIe+tM+utS\n1lwbuB4EMVLFe9HUluFiE7HbBE/QrJdHDRLegNqeYW+9ZKgVFsvYUrZ60ruG0sMI\nCEp2HlNccyr0oQcSt0nFY0VBqz+9u9PQ/jO0YbB8jXfNxlQnSePwHBqRkwWaJOUj\