sed tests\n\nThree spec files cover:\n- 01-versionsCleanerAPI: all GraphQL operations (isRunning, getConfig, saveConfig, runCleaner) including roundtrip and already-running assertions\n- 02-versionsCleanerExecution: Execution page form fields, Run button state, run flow alerts\n- 03-versionsCleanerConfiguration: Configuration page fields, cron disabled state, save flow with GraphQL roundtrip\n\nBoilerplate follows the DONE module pattern: @jahia/cypress v7 CI scripts, Docker Compose, Dockerfile, provisioning manifests.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a542a93ea7bf5c69f3da14cf9386aa992c3758d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/trees/7a542a93ea7bf5c69f3da14cf9386aa992c3758d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/versions-cleaner/git/commits/9d0dd8ec369a84f03776bfdc343c7de76e000d97","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a542a93ea7bf5c69f3da14cf9386aa992c3758d\nparent 43415c908cd47fc9835d678861123cb2ace29da2\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778182926 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778182926 +0200\n\nfeat(tests): add Cypress Docker-based tests\n\nThree spec files cover:\n- 01-versionsCleanerAPI: all GraphQL operations (isRunning, getConfig, saveConfig, runCleaner) including roundtrip and already-running assertions\n- 02-versionsCleanerExecution: Execution page form fields, Run button state, run flow alerts\n- 03-versionsCleanerConfiguration: Configuration page fields, cron disabled state, save flow with GraphQL roundtrip\n\nBoilerplate follows the DONE module pattern: @jahia/cypress v7 CI scripts, Docker Compose, Dockerfile, provisioning manifests.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmn86w4ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3kEPggAzWblJ/5bh2zJPUuA6OFHcrEfE41EEfo7AaatdBSf2QY97+2OnWKHyI/2\n3bzPWUYz849LMcZSYy7+M8V8ntVz3DunrMXu3+NLG5ZwKmuRRjC/lTBtyBQ0BVDd\