karmalkarthoughtworks","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/bahmni-lab-frontend/commits/04b0c9caef67b2f3f5149f70c72766b33ce4e5c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:28:34Z","email":"96288645+vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks@users.noreply.github.com","name":"vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:28:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"BAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI (#81)\n\n* BAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI\n\nAdds .github/workflows/trufflehog.yml. Runs TruffleHog OSS on pull\nrequests, pushes to the default branch, and weekly over full history.\n\nOnly credentials verified live against the provider''s API fail the job\n(--results=verified), so vendored test fixtures and .env placeholders are\nignored. Both actions are pinned to commit SHAs and the workflow requests\nonly contents: read.\n\n* BAH-5025 | Drop the weekly cron from the TruffleHog workflow\n\nGitHub disables a scheduled workflow in a public repo after 60 days with no\nrepository activity, and the disable applies to the whole workflow, not just\nthe cron trigger. Bahmni/bahmni-api-test-automation and\nBahmni/openmrs-module-bedmanagement had already lost Semgrep on every PR this\nway, and GitHub does not re-enable it when the repo becomes active again.\n\nScanning on pull_request and on push to the default branch is unchanged, and\nworkflow_dispatch stays for an on-demand full scan.","tree":{"sha":"05f1feac6500125401f8e434259ce52797744c37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/bahmni-lab-frontend/git/trees/05f1feac6500125401f8e434259ce52797744c37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/bahmni-lab-frontend/git/commits/04b0c9caef67b2f3f5149f70c72766b33ce4e5c6","verification":{"payload":"tree 05f1feac6500125401f8e434259ce52797744c37\nparent 0c8ab6cf7f4b1d70fa1de11840a3260c5e14af98\nauthor vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks <96288645+vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks@users.noreply.github.com> 1791350914 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791350914 +0530\n\nBAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI (#81)\n\n* BAH-5025 | Add TruffleHog secret scanning to CI\n\nAdds .github/workflows/trufflehog.yml. Runs TruffleHog OSS on pull\nrequests, pushes to the default branch, and weekly over full history.\n\nOnly credentials verified live against the provider''s API fail the job\n(--results=verified), so vendored test fixtures and .env placeholders are\nignored. Both actions are pinned to commit SHAs and the workflow requests\nonly contents: read.\n\n* BAH-5025 | Drop the weekly cron from the TruffleHog workflow\n\nGitHub disables a scheduled workflow in a public repo after 60 days with no\nrepository activity, and the disable applies to the whole workflow, not just\nthe cron trigger. Bahmni/bahmni-api-test-automation and\nBahmni/openmrs-module-bedmanagement had already lost Semgrep on every PR this\nway, and GitHub does not re-enable it when the repo becomes active again.\n\nScanning on pull_request and on push to the default branch is unchanged, and\nworkflow_dispatch stays for an on-demand full scan.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxdiCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaKMQABl8DCsE32DiYLbhUqDSthnL\njiE2deYSg1Txvjyd3/BSuhFR8NwWOVo0NONg9qOjbif/tPsOLMN6vhO8DcBsdZtF\nJGhU2X9Xtexkl/EhHIX3JAygFCwIcfrf7FGy5FElz3q2RRivEPUCl/Dr4wm1AC8O\nLbJwUKDU/w7/GHxm0mddnxUVLqyZkUpcMKGYvNvR/lkoRFkODlhqdYEVhowzKppt\nKrM44I3cJ0YqfgW7US7lDVQsvP3wcGDGemTID7nn633+iy/nx3tRca78SSAcjTNS\n5we/heEc8BIQa7bR9qzjRN0WdFXMqGTd4UdgiwZJLselNeIphjHv31AN3ZQj/QGb\njwhW6Mo6xI4QN6O6FVrGuSLrUezvj1n+YCI2xzX39QS210DQlDdi5E5wMGWfmRXc\nJQW72cL0ZGBdH9gBfP/UBUircI9sEiEfHTA29uvKxJiAz5aXqUdLf10ScNESvB27\n7nG3ojIMwgLRzKqjFXDpyuHWFWxTospXrubaYRbKrdJMHHdOgJoIC8BdWX0aeH75\nxMm6RIBoM1lErM6aANA2WJOTVoQBRqVQYZX9t9F4bjPKUZscx1U1U8N368jqNY3n\nBpRA7JuX4xmrVsojsZQrlhSgmX3lCByZV1vqNAQsmQXkend7h6o450+qXjFklQEd\nGcJwgKiEwRJNLnqLbXQU\n=JyDE\n-----END 