r_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks","id":96288645,"login":"vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks","node_id":"U_kgDOBb0_hQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/bahmni-lab-frontend/commits/0c8ab6cf7f4b1d70fa1de11840a3260c5e14af98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:18:31Z","email":"96288645+vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks@users.noreply.github.com","name":"vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T05:18:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"BAH-5024 | Add Semgrep SAST CI workflow (#80)\n\n* BAH-5024 | Add Semgrep SAST CI workflow\n\nAdds .github/workflows/semgrep.yml. Runs Semgrep Community Edition on PRs, pushes to main/master, and weekly. Phase 1 is non-blocking (continue-on-error: true) while initial findings are triaged. Findings upload to the Security tab via SARIF.\n\nNo SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN required; no Semgrep Cloud account.\n\nPinned to immutable digests/SHAs per the bahmni-core#330 template.\n\n* BAH-5024 | Drop the weekly cron from the Semgrep workflow\n\nGitHub disables a scheduled workflow in a public repo after 60 days with no\nrepository activity, and the disable applies to the whole workflow, not just\nthe cron trigger. Bahmni/bahmni-api-test-automation and\nBahmni/openmrs-module-bedmanagement had already lost Semgrep on every PR this\nway, and GitHub does not re-enable it when the repo becomes active again.\n\nScanning on pull_request and on push to the default branch is unchanged, and\nworkflow_dispatch stays for an on-demand full scan.","tree":{"sha":"a82d033130928c319ba50e55ab7b5770abb51296","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/bahmni-lab-frontend/git/trees/a82d033130928c319ba50e55ab7b5770abb51296"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bahmni/bahmni-lab-frontend/git/commits/0c8ab6cf7f4b1d70fa1de11840a3260c5e14af98","verification":{"payload":"tree a82d033130928c319ba50e55ab7b5770abb51296\nparent ec45f801bf6569c32e47a7d9e91b3bc4b0c6897d\nauthor vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks <96288645+vishalkarmalkarthoughtworks@users.noreply.github.com> 1791350311 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791350311 +0530\n\nBAH-5024 | Add Semgrep SAST CI workflow (#80)\n\n* BAH-5024 | Add Semgrep SAST CI workflow\n\nAdds .github/workflows/semgrep.yml. Runs Semgrep Community Edition on PRs, pushes to main/master, and weekly. Phase 1 is non-blocking (continue-on-error: true) while initial findings are triaged. Findings upload to the Security tab via SARIF.\n\nNo SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN required; no Semgrep Cloud account.\n\nPinned to immutable digests/SHAs per the bahmni-core#330 template.\n\n* BAH-5024 | Drop the weekly cron from the Semgrep workflow\n\nGitHub disables a scheduled workflow in a public repo after 60 days with no\nrepository activity, and the disable applies to the whole workflow, not just\nthe cron trigger. Bahmni/bahmni-api-test-automation and\nBahmni/openmrs-module-bedmanagement had already lost Semgrep on every PR this\nway, and GitHub does not re-enable it when the repo becomes active again.\n\nScanning on pull_request and on push to the default branch is unchanged, and\nworkflow_dispatch stays for an on-demand full scan.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxdYnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADIMQACHr+NYH68Iewz