t: add nebula galaxy configurations and scene management utilities\n\n- Introduced `galaxies.ts` to define various nebula galaxy configurations with properties such as id, name, description, position, rotation, and nebula parameters.\n- Created `nebulaFactory.ts` for reusable functions to generate textures, backgrounds, and star fields, including methods for creating spark textures and disposing of Three.js objects.\n- Implemented `useNebulaScene.ts` to manage the nebula scene lifecycle, including initialization, resizing, rendering, and event handling for user interactions with galaxies.","tree":{"sha":"e462937ad2e443e497f3e7b9859e6c32039f7878","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Not-have/demo/git/trees/e462937ad2e443e497f3e7b9859e6c32039f7878"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Not-have/demo/git/commits/3c27a128e55f82206f32011b9d899e5019e6fd70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Not-have/demo/commit/3c27a128e55f82206f32011b9d899e5019e6fd70","node_id":"C_kwDOHI4nctoAKDNjMjdhMTI4ZTU1ZjgyMjA2ZjMyMDExYjlkODk5ZTUwMTllNmZkNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Not-have/demo/commit/5eb92214100dc1626efd080060d021e0bb008595","sha":"5eb92214100dc1626efd080060d021e0bb008595","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Not-have/demo/commits/5eb92214100dc1626efd080060d021e0bb008595"}],"sha":"3c27a128e55f82206f32011b9d899e5019e6fd70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Not-have/demo/commits/3c27a128e55f82206f32011b9d899e5019e6fd70"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Not-have/demo/commits/5eb92214100dc1626efd080060d021e0bb008595/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:41:11Z","email":"yong.li@yidatec.com","name":"李勇"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:41:11Z","email":"yong.li@yidatec.com","name":"李勇"},"message":"feat(星云演示): 重构星云视图，添加多个星系数据及其渲染逻辑","tree":{"sha":"556168ce9c9c661be823385d4320439ab3c73072",